        en: "Enjoy choosing a precious silk scarf woven in one of the town's workshops, the mark of an age-old Mahdia craft, or a pair of fouta, the long bath towels made in the region whose bright colours and fine stripes have made them a fashion accessory — as well as multicoloured ceramic tableware, Kairouan carpets and many other handicrafts.",
